&lt;p>Package draw provides image composition functions.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	draw 包提供图像合成函数。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>See “The Go image/draw package” for an introduction to this package: &lt;a href="https://golang.org/doc/articles/image_draw.html">https://golang.org/doc/articles/image_draw.html&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	有关此包的介绍，请参阅“Go image/draw 包”：https://golang.org/doc/articles/image_draw.html&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>gif</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/image/gif/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/image/gif/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote>
