&lt;p>Package image implements a basic 2-D image library.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	image 包实现了一个基本的 2-D 图像库。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The fundamental interface is called Image. An Image contains colors, which are described in the image/color package.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	基本接口称为 Image。Image 包含颜色，这些颜色在 image/color 包中进行了描述。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>jpeg</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/image/jpeg/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/image/jpeg/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote>
